cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Building Regulatory Requirements Diagrams"
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
type: dataset

authors:
  - family-names: Fontanella
    given-names: Luca
    email: luca.fontanella@gmail.com
    affiliation: "Università Iuav di Venezia"

repository-code: "https://github.com/lfontanella/building-regulatory-requirements-diagrams"

abstract: >
  Visual diagrams and BPMN-style workflows for the interpretation and
  structuring of selected building regulatory requirements in BIM/openBIM
  workflows. The repository includes diagrams related to CAM requirements and
  to the Italian D.M. 26 giugno 2015 on minimum building energy performance
  requirements, developed as part of a PhD research project on BIM, HBIM,
  openBIM and building performance analysis.

keywords:
  - BIM
  - openBIM
  - HBIM
  - regulatory requirements
  - information requirements
  - building performance
  - energy performance
  - thermal performance
  - BPMN
  - workflow diagrams
  - CAM
  - DM 26 giugno 2015
  - IDS
  - IFC
  - research documentation

